    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend Your Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last bastion. \u00a0Stand strong against monsters and ghouls as they carry out a full-out attack to destroy your base. Survive long enough to acquire candies, obtain powerups, and protect your base from destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Ways To Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign Mode: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through 9 unique campaign levels, each with their own twists and challenges to conquer.\u00a0 Do you have what it takes to break the curse once and for all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Mode:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight endlessly against monsters and ghouls while obtaining new powerups and curses every few rounds. How long will you hold out for before the monsters overtake your base?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield the power of the elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself an edge in battle by harnessing the power of the elements to your advantage. Magic-imbued crystals can be unlocked to powerup your saw during combat, letting you slice through the incoming monsters with ease. If you see a crystal appear, destroy it with your saw and watch the magic unfold. Try stacking multiple elements on top of each other to create devastating combinations!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Rewards &amp; Customize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you earn achievements in Sawmania, you will be rewarded with a bonus currency that you may redeem in the <i>Trades &amp; Offers</i> store in exchange for miscellaneous cosmetic items. These allow you to customize your gameplay experience by equipping any combination of launchers, saw skins, and particle trails. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend Your Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last bastion. \u00a0Stand strong against monsters and ghouls as they carry out a full-out attack to destroy your base. Survive long enough to acquire candies, obtain powerups, and protect your base from destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Ways To Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign Mode: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through 9 unique campaign levels, each with their own twists and challenges to conquer.\u00a0 Do you have what it takes to break the curse once and for all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Mode:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight endlessly against monsters and ghouls while obtaining new powerups and curses every few rounds. How long will you hold out for before the monsters overtake your base?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield the power of the elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself an edge in battle by harnessing the power of the elements to your advantage. Magic-imbued crystals can be unlocked to powerup your saw during combat, letting you slice through the incoming monsters with ease. If you see a crystal appear, destroy it with your saw and watch the magic unfold. Try stacking multiple elements on top of each other to create devastating combinations!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Rewards &amp; Customize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you earn achievements in Sawmania, you will be rewarded with a bonus currency that you may redeem in the <i>Trades &amp; Offers</i> store in exchange for miscellaneous cosmetic items. These allow you to customize your gameplay experience by equipping any combination of launchers, saw skins, and particle trails. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Protect your base against an onslaught of monsters using your mighty saw!",
